    {
      "speaker": "プロデューサー",
      "text": "（合力搭建简易遮阳棚——みんなの様子を確かめながら、声をかけた）",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_01",
        "zh": "（合力搭建简易遮阳棚——一边确认大家的状态，一边上前搭话）",
        "speakerZh": "制作人",
        "note": "[小段 1: 合力搭建简易遮阳棚] 回到营地后，制作人负责固定漂流木支架，甘奈与羽那帮忙铺设宽大树叶并压紧边",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "合力搭建简易遮阳棚"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甘奈",
      "text": "プロデューサーさん、見て見て☆ 海がすっごく綺麗だよ！甘奈、みんなと来られて超嬉しいな♪",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "amana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "014",
      "clothId": "014",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile1",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_02",
        "zh": "制作人先生，快看快看☆ 大海超级漂亮哦！甘奈能和大家一起来，超开心的♪",
        "speakerZh": "大崎甘奈",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "合力搭建简易遮阳棚"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "わぁ……！プロデューサーさん、海風がすっごく気持ちいいです～！あたし、ワクワクしてきちゃいました！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 776,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile1",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_03",
        "zh": "哇啊……！制作人先生，海风吹得好舒服呀～！我总觉得心里扑通扑通地兴奋起来了呢！",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "合力搭建简易遮阳棚"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甘奈",
      "text": "えへへ、日差しが眩しいかも……でもプロデューサーさんが隣なら、甘奈ぜんぜん平気だよ☆",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "amana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "014",
      "clothId": "014",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "shy1",
      "charAnim2": "face_shy",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
      "lip": "lip_shy",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_04",
        "zh": "嘿嘿，阳光有点刺眼呢……不过有制作人先生在身边，甘奈完全没问题哦☆",
        "speakerZh": "大崎甘奈",
        "surfaceEmotion": "shy_flustered",
        "innerEmotion": "affection_bashful",
        "vocalTone": "breath_flutter",
        "note": "[小段 2: 海岸布置求救信号] 遮阳棚完工后，三人转移到开阔的海岸线，利用外景带来的反光板、亮色布料和随",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "海岸布置求救信号"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "えっ、ほんとですか！？ さすがプロデューサーさんです！あたしもいーっぱいお手伝いしちゃいますね！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 776,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "surp1",
      "charAnim2": "face_surp",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
      "lip": "lip_surp",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_05",
        "zh": "咦，真的吗！？不愧是制作人先生！我也要帮大家好多好多的忙哦！",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "surprise_wide",
        "innerEmotion": "alert_spark",
        "vocalTone": "bright_pop",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "海岸布置求救信号"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甘奈",
      "text": "うんっ☆ どんなことがあっても、甘奈たちなら最高の思い出にできるよね、プロデューサーさん♪",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "amana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "014",
      "clothId": "014",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile2",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_06",
        "zh": "嗯☆ 不管遇到什么突发状况，只要是甘奈我们，一定能变成最棒的回忆对吧，制作人先生♪",
        "speakerZh": "大崎甘奈",
        "surfaceEmotion": "smile_gentle",
        "innerEmotion": "performative_sweet",
        "vocalTone": "sweet_performative",
        "note": "[小段 3: 星空下的不安与安慰] 深夜海风微凉，一直强装镇定的甘奈终于小声说出担心大家与甜花会为自己着急的",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "星空下的不安与安慰",
        "x-beatBgmAuto": "0091",
        "x-bgmReason": "角色在星空下卸下心防吐露不安，切入温柔抒情配乐"
      },
      "bgm": "003"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "えへへ、プロデューサーさんが笑ってくれると、あたしまでぽかぽかしちゃいます！一緒に頑張りましょうね！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 776,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile2",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_07",
        "zh": "嘿嘿，看到制作人先生笑起来，连我心里也暖洋洋的呢！我们一起加油吧！",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "smile_gentle",
        "innerEmotion": "performative_sweet",
        "vocalTone": "sweet_performative",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "星空下的不安与安慰"
      }
    },
